id: pm-miy5k6
title: "GH-907: preflight override ownership and statically disjoint command scopes"
description: Add public SDK ownership contracts for preflight overrides so multiple extensions can declare non-overlapping command scopes and package health only warns for genuinely ambiguous registrations.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[6]: agent-ux,"area:extensions","area:sdk",collision,ownership,preflight
