author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Extension authors can declare normalized command ownership for imperative and declarative preflight overrides; Runtime dispatch never invokes a scoped preflight override outside its declared commands; Doctor and health suppress collision warnings only for provably disjoint non-empty scopes and keep overlapping or unscoped warnings; The public surface snapshot docs examples and isolated multi-extension acceptance tests cover compatibility and negative controls
parent: pm-ugqx
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: fixed
expected_result: Disjoint scoped preflight overrides coexist without false collision warnings while overlapping or unscoped overrides remain conservative.
actual_result: "Scoped ownership now propagates through SDK definitions, inventories, diagnostics, runtime dispatch, scaffolds, tests, docs, and isolated acceptance."
