body: "Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/907\\n\\nDeliver an additive public SDK contract spanning imperative registration, declarative authoring, activation inventories, collision diagnostics, package doctor/health, runtime dispatch, testing helpers, examples, and docs. Preserve legacy unscoped callbacks as compatibility inputs while treating them as conservatively overlapping."
